# Build caches
*.tsbuildinfo

# Redis persistence snapshots. NEVER commit: they contain live runtime state —
# `jwt:revoked:*` session identifiers and `otp:resend:*` counters.
#
# Globbed rather than named, because `dump.rdb` is only the default:
# `dbfilename` renames it, a per-port instance is conventionally
# `redis-<port>.rdb`, and `redis-cli --rdb <file>` writes whatever it is told.
# Every one of those holds the same session state as the default name.
*.rdb

# Database dumps. A dump contains every resident's personal data in plaintext,
# including encrypted-at-rest columns in their encrypted form plus everything
# that is not encrypted. It must never reach the repository.
backups/
*.dump
*.sql.gz
